# Default: ignore everything that isn't explicitly whitelisted below.
# Goal: nothing but the protocol proxy lists should ever be added/pushed.
*

# Allow git to descend into subdirectories so the whitelist can match inside them.
!*/

# Whitelist: this file + the four protocol list files.
!.gitignore
!http.lst
!https.lst
!socks4.lst
!socks5.lst
